24
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:52,250
Outer Suzaku Tomb

25
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,290
The Suzaku Tomb isn’t large,

26
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,930
it's divided into the inner and outer tomb.

27
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,360
A single sweep of Divine Sense

28
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:58,090
should help you find an altar.

29
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,770
Pass through it to enter the inner tomb.

30
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,610
There is a mountain at the center,

31
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,840
that is Ye Wuyou’s tomb.

32
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,480
Will you...

33
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,080
play with me ?

34
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,890
A monster ?

35
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,480
No.

36
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,680
It seems that the fire element of this place

37
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,080
manifested as a fire spirit.

38
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,210
As expected,

39
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,730
the scorched earth of this place

40
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,320
will endlessly heal this thing.

41
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,600
Will you...

42
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,440
play with me !?

43
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,450
Break !

44
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,810
This is

45
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:52,330
a soul strand ?

46
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,120
Every grain of this scorched earth

47
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:55,560
is actually a soul strand.

48
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,730
These soul strands are weak,

49
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,290
so they must be mortals.

50
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,960
Situ said the soul strands are in the inner tomb.

51
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:04,600
So why are they here ?

52
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,840
Could it be

53
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,480
that my soul strand is also one of these spirits ?

54
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:15,970
3 days later

55
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,520
3 days

56
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,720
and still no trace of the altar.

57
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:20,400
Senior !

58
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,760
Senior, save me !

59
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,800
If you help me

60
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,200
I can tell you

61
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,480
how to enter the inner tomb !

62
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,210
Junior's name is Murong Yun.

63
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:47,170
Thank you, seniors, for saving me.

64
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:50,610
Mo Yunhai
Early stage Soul Transformation

65
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:49,320
This old man is Mo Yunhai.

66
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,000
Fellow cultivator,

67
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,760
you're really skilled.

68
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,520
Junior,

69
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,160
you said that

70
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:59,040
you know how to enter the inner tomb.

71
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:00,480
Senior Mo,

72
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,260
when I arrived here

73
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:03,530
I saw Qian Feng

74
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:05,090
with several Forsaken Immortal Clan Warriors

75
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,530
enter the inner tomb.

76
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,490
If not for my low cultivation,

77
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:10,250
I'd have entered too.

78
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:14,130
I wonder where they entered.

79
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:16,050
At an altar.

80
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:18,290
But it's very remote

81
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,090
and the entrance has complex restrictions.

82
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:22,130
With all these strange things nearby,

83
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,610
I couldn't enter it alone.

84
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,480
If you can promise

85
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,360
to take me in with you,

86
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,730
then Junior

87
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,410
will lead you both there.

88
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,880
Fellow cultivator,

89
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,000
it should be manageable

90
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,040
if we join forces.

91
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,120
What do you think ?

92
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,410
This is the place !

93
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:58,120
Is this altar

94
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,000
the one you mentioned ?

95
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,690
That central spot

96
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,490
is the entrance.

97
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,400
Soul Search !

98
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,840
He's not lying.

99
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:18,130
However,

100
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:20,880
only one person can enter successfully.

101
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,850
I confirm it's here.

102
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,600
Fellow cultivator,

103
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,520
I'll go first.

104
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,690
You're quite clever.

105
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:42,930
How did you notice ?

106
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:44,480
I can tell you

107
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:47,080
but you'll have to answer my questions first.

108
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,720
Interesting...

109
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,490
But you answer me first !

110
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,200
Your clothes are ancient,

111
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,440
modern cultivators don't wear those.

112
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,130
Just this was enough ?

113
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,680
Of course, there are other reasons.

114
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,680
Now you tell me.

115
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,930
Who

116
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,200
are you ?

117
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,640
I'm formed from soul strands.

118
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,560
Why are you here ?

119
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,650
When this place shattered,

120
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:11,400
soul strands scattered everywhere.

121
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:13,360
Your soul strand might be nearby,

122
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,400
right over there.

123
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,090
What's your objective ?

124
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,890
I have no particular purpose.

125
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,970
I just don't want people to succeed.

126
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,050
Your turn now.

127
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,530
What gave me out ?

128
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,970
The spiritual energy in those lightning bolts

129
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,920
was enough to kill you instantly

130
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:32,040
but they just kept following you.

131
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,970
Your self-centered act was too fake.

132
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,530
Tell me,

133
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,000
where is the real altar ?

134
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:39,640
You'll never know !

135
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,490
Seal !

136
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:59,450
Even if you kill these soul strands,

137
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:01,210
it's people of planet Suzaku that will die.

138
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,440
But I

139
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:05,760
can absorb new soul strands to revive.

140
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:08,000
You can't kill me !

141
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,080
I won't kill you,

142
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,640
but I will seal you.

143
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:21,880
You will be cut off from the outside.

144
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:25,280
When your host's lifespan ends,

145
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,640
you

146
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,920
will also die.

147
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:32,050
I'll tell you where the altar is !

148
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:32,840
Now let me out !

149
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,440
Speak.

150
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,450
East of here

151
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,650
in a valley surrounded by 9 peaks.

152
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:41,080
The mist there is white instead of black.

153
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,890
The altar is at the bottom.

154
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,640
You liar !

155
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,880
As more cultivators

156
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:02,200
discovered the secret of the soul strands,

157
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:05,720
they started slaughtering them repeatedly,

158
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:08,410
waiting for their own soul strand to appear.

159
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:11,680
This cruel method was sacrificing the lives of others

160
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:13,880
to find their own soul strand.

161
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:17,080
This made the situation in the Suzaku Tomb

162
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,920
even more chaotic.

163
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,850
It should have recovered by now,

164
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,410
lure it out again.

165
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:47,450
Still no sign of my soul strand !

166
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,090
Explode !

167
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,650
He...

168
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:03,800
He's dead...

169
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,370
His soul strand was destroyed.

170
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:08,880
Again !

171
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:11,050
We're waiting here for my soul strand.

172
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,410
If it doesn't appear,

173
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,610
then each time it reforms

174
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,440
we kill the spirit.

175
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:23,450
Outer Suzaku Tomb Altar

176
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,800
Long time no see,

177
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,040
Wang Lin...

178
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:32,840
Scram !

179
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:40,570
You really are Early stage Soul Transformation...

180
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,520
Your progress is astonishing.

181
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,050
Zhuque Zi's death is imminent.

182
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,450
Our battle

183
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,730
is unnecessary.

184
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:49,370
I don't just fight you

185
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:51,280
because my master told me to.

186
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:54,890
It's for your Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain.

187
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:56,010
Am I right ?

188
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,480
I use illusions

189
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:59,280
to experience mortal emotions

190
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:01,000
and cultivate ruthlessness.

191
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,770
While you

192
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,680
started with emotions

193
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,290
to comprehend Life and Death.

194
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,320
By becoming mortal

195
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:09,490
you understood the Dao of Life and Death !

196
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:10,760
You and I

197
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,640
are the same.

198
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,870
I don't have time for this

199
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,850
but Liu Mei is Middle stage Soul Transformation

200
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,330
so I can't end this quickly...

201
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:22,320
I must get my soul strand as fast as possible.

202
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:25,650
If you dare to use the Billion-Soul Flag,

203
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:28,090
I'll just destroy this altar.

204
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,280
It will take days to reform

205
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,890
and you can't wait that long...

206
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,480
What do you really want ?

207
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:43,760
I just need one last illusion to complete my domain

208
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,760
and reach Late stage Soul Transformation.

209
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,770
I will borrow your Dao

210
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:50,520
to complete my Thousand Illusions.

211
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:52,440
What do you think ?

212
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,120
Just one illusion ?

213
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:57,920
I'll show you,

214
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:00,080
just don't regret it later.

215
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,800
My Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain

216
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:09,360
is like a peacock's thousand feathers.

217
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:10,720
Each feather

218
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:12,120
is an illusion.

219
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:13,440
Each illusion

220
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:15,080
is one of my avatar's lifetimes.

221
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,560
Now that only the last one remains

222
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,090
You...

223
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:21,320
will become my cauldron !

224
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:23,760
Red Butterfly's Ruthless Domain

225
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:25,440
required severing love.

226
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,130
But this woman is so cold-hearted

227
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:29,610
that she has no love to sever.

228
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,560
Her domain

229
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:33,440
is far above Red Butterfly's.

230
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,880
The beauty of this world

231
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:40,120
resides in its ruthlessness.

232
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,290
The beauty of a rainbow

233
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:44,120
is admired by millions

234
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:46,640
but cannot be captured.

235
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:49,320
Like the tail of a peacock,

236
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:51,610
even if it's beautiful,

237
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:53,360
it can rarely be seen.

238
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:55,080
Ruthless...

239
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:57,480
I thought that your domain

240
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,720
was aligned with the law of the heavens.

241
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:03,330
Our paths diverge but we share the same ruthlessness.

242
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:07,290
I never expected your domain to have such a glaring flaw.

243
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:10,130
It makes devouring your domain easy.

244
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:12,640
It's almost a bit disappointing.

245
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,250
Devour !

246
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:19,610
Who cares about the law of the heavens ?

247
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:21,170
Between heaven and earth,

248
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:22,960
what must die will die

249
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:26,560
even if the law of the heavens allow the opposite.

250
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,290
I don't agree with that.

251
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:31,280
Your last illusion

252
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:33,200
will not be my domain.

253
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:36,360
Life and Death Reincarnation cycle !

254
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:43,970
I really like this physical body

255
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:46,120
that you have found for me.

256
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:50,850
Brother Wang,

257
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:53,610
this is how much I understood of Liu Mei's domain.

258
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,640
She only needs one last illusion

259
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,920
to reach a thousand.

260
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:59,000
Brother Wang, you must be careful.

261
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:03,210
If Liu Mei really wants to devour my domain,

262
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:05,890
then I'm no match for her with my cultivation.

263
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,400
There is only one way

264
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,410
to break her Dao Heart.

265
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:13,160
Little brother,

266
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:16,010
you finally remembered me.

267
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:18,520
I think you need a new body.

268
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:20,690
I'll help you get one

269
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:22,360
and give you back your freedom.

270
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:26,010
Lust is the perfect counter to Liu Mei's Ruthlessness.

271
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,920
Once Mei Ji takes over,

272
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:30,160
Liu Mei will lose her mind

273
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:32,560
and become Mei Ji's puppet.

274
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,600
Wang Lin...

275
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:36,640
you bastard !

276
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:39,280
If you hadn't insisted on devouring my domain,

277
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:42,770
I wouldn't have had the chance to let Mei Ji possess you.

278
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,530
You brought

279
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:46,280
all this upon yourself !

280
00:13:46,750 --> 00:13:47,760
Seal !

281
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:51,080
The Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain

282
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,560
will be stained by lust

283
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,770
breaking its ruthlessness.

284
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,130
Formation,

285
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:58,930
activate !

286
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,600
Little sister,

287
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:09,850
will you obediently give me your physical body ?

288
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,210
What's wrong ?

289
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:23,430
A part of my domain

290
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:25,170
is about to possess a body.

291
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:27,090
Is that your old

292
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:28,320
Lust Domain ?

293
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,760
If the possession succeeds

294
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:33,080
she will take a part of my power.

295
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:34,810
I can't allow this.

296
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:37,600
I need to wipe her out today.

297
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:47,290
How can there be a force interrupting the possession !?

298
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:49,920
She wants to get rid of me !

299
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,320
Activate !

300
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:01,810
Since neither can take over the body

301
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:03,440
then we will merge !

302
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:45,560
I didn't expect

303
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:48,720
that my final illusion

304
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:50,880
would be one of lust.

305
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:52,920
Wang Lin,

306
00:15:53,350 --> 00:15:55,440
you have ruined my Dao Heart

307
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:58,810
by transforming my domain into the Thousand Illusions Lust Domain !

308
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,690
This grudge between us

309
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:02,360
is irreconcilable !

310
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:11,650
Mountain River
Suzaku Tomb

311
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:16,160
According to Situ,

312
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:19,450
there should be a mountain in the center of the inner tomb.

313
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:21,370
The crystal should be there.

314
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,730
I think that in order to find the center,

315
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:25,120
I need to cross this ravine.

316
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:28,490
The soul strands here

317
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:29,880
are getting stronger.

318
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,690
I'd rather not provoke them.

319
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:41,890
Shit !

320
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:44,330
The tomb's collapse is accelerating !

321
00:16:55,660 --> 00:19:32,080
The scene was already cryptic in the novel, it's even more confusing in the donghua. It will get explained later anyways. Feel free to read what happened in the novel and try to read between the lines:

Her domain was currently far above Wang Lin’s Life and Death Domain, which was only at the Early stage of Soul Transformation, so he obviously couldn’t resist it.
The pink mist that covered everything within tens of thousands of kilometers was now slowly condensing back toward the valley.
This process lasted for two days. All of the pink mist outside of the valley had come back, but the valley itself was still covered in pink mist. From inside the mist, the painful cries of a woman could be heard, but that voice was also filled with pleasure. The voice was like the song of a fairy that would make anyone’s heart pound and blood surge.
After an unknown amount of time, the pink mist gradually faded, revealing a woman lying on the side of the altar. Clarity slowly returned to her eyes.
[...]
“I can’t believe that the last illusion of the Thousand Illusion Ruthless Domain is this illusion. The moment this illusion appears, the domain changes to the Thousand Illusion Lust Domain. All of this is like an illusion, yet it is so real. I never thought that my Thousand Illusion Ruthless Domain’s last illusion would be obtained like this… Master wanted me to leave my mark on Wang Lin’s dao heart, but he never would have thought that my last illusion would contain his aura…”
[...]
Wang Lin’s body appeared in a wasteland in the inner section of the Suzaku Tomb. After he appeared, he looked into the sky with a very complex expression.
While being surrounded by the pink mist, he felt like he was in a dream. When the pink mist dissipated, he saw a woman below him. At that moment, his heart felt pain for her.

322
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:16,330
To let go of the consequences of my actions

323
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:18,050
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

324
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:19,990
like scattered ink.

325
00:17:20,620 --> 00:17:27,470
As destiny falls

326
00:17:23,460 --> 00:17:27,470
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

327
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:35,070
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

328
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:35,070
wither and melt into rivers.

329
00:17:35,260 --> 00:17:42,630
Who can deceive

330
00:17:38,020 --> 00:17:42,630
the law of the heavens ?

331
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:45,950
Countless generations

332
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:45,950
have tried before me.

333
00:17:45,990 --> 00:17:49,670
But how could I not catch my dreams

334
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:49,670
within my warm fingers ?

335
00:17:49,980 --> 00:17:53,750
You're at my side when I'm alone

336
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:57,070
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

337
00:17:57,580 --> 00:18:01,030
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

338
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:05,230
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

339
00:18:02,980 --> 00:18:05,230
in the streets.

340
00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:10,190
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

341
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:10,190
Can I break the rules ?

342
00:18:09,950 --> 00:18:12,910
To run towards you !

343
00:18:12,700 --> 00:18:16,230
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

344
00:18:15,980 --> 00:18:20,870
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

345
00:18:20,620 --> 00:18:24,270
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

346
00:18:24,060 --> 00:18:28,950
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

347
00:18:29,150 --> 00:18:34,630
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

348
00:18:34,500 --> 00:18:38,550
If your soul is willing to wander,

349
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:43,190
can I still take your hands

350
00:18:39,980 --> 00:18:43,190
and hold them tight ?

351
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:46,270
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

352
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:51,150
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

353
00:18:50,910 --> 00:18:54,430
I dream of destroying

354
00:18:54,340 --> 00:18:59,150
the shackles of our fate.

355
00:18:58,900 --> 00:19:03,110
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

356
00:19:02,860 --> 00:19:05,910
You're the hardest to let go of.

357
00:19:05,740 --> 00:19:09,790
I want to be with you again

358
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:13,150
so I can look in your eyes.

359
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:18,390
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
